### Solution transfer component

comp-solution-transfer-fill-normal = Вы наполняете {THE($target)} до {$amount}u от {THE($owner)}.
comp-solution-transfer-fill-fully = Вы наполняете {THE($target)} доверху на {$amount} единиц из {THE($owner)}.
comp-solution-transfer-transfer-solution = Вы перевели {$amount}u игроку {THE($target)}.

## Displayed when trying to transfer to a solution, but either the giver is empty or the taker is full
comp-solution-transfer-is-empty = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} пуст!
comp-solution-transfer-is-full = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} заполнен!

## Displayed in change transfer amount verb's name
comp-solution-transfer-verb-custom-amount = Пользовательский
comp-solution-transfer-verb-amount = {$amount} ед.
comp-solution-transfer-verb-toggle = Переключить на {$amount}u

## Displayed after you successfully change a solution's amount using the BUI
comp-solution-transfer-set-amount = Сумма перевода установлена на {$amount}u.
comp-solution-transfer-set-amount-max = Макс: {$amount} ед.
comp-solution-transfer-set-amount-min = Мин: {$amount} ед.

